The trusted execution chain becomes:
USER
 ↓
API REQUEST
 ↓
AUTHORIZED COMMAND
 ↓
JOB
 ↓
WORKER
 ↓
DOMAIN OPERATION
 ↓
VALIDATION
 ↓
